{"id":"1ec9054a89b9ba1b","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-stalks-detect-equality-and-isomorphisms.md","title":"Theorem II.6 Stalks Detect Equality and Isomorphisms","display":"Theorem II.6 Stalks Detect Equality and Isomorphisms","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-stalks-detect-equality-and-isomorphisms","aliases":["14-thm-stalks-detect-equality-and-isomorphisms"],"display":"Theorem II.6 Stalks Detect Equality and Isomorphisms","depends_on":["[[14-df-stalk-maps]]","[[14-thm-sheaf-recovery-from-germ-sections]]","[[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]"],"source_location":"II.6 Corollary 5 and Proposition 6, printed 92–94; DjVu 52–53","source_evidence":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-stalks-detect-equality-and-isomorphisms"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-stalks-detect-equality-and-isomorphisms</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem II.6 Stalks Detect Equality and Isomorphisms"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"35aa7f1836ebd037\" href=\"?note=35aa7f1836ebd037\" title=\"14-df-stalk-maps\">14-df-stalk-maps</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b95e7093b0f57f47\" href=\"?note=b95e7093b0f57f47\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-recovery-from-germ-sections\">14-thm-sheaf-recovery-from-germ-sections</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"83765a3303e549f5\" href=\"?note=83765a3303e549f5\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections\">14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"II.6 Corollary 5 and Proposition 6, printed 92–94; DjVu 52–53"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；空间载体、截面值与指标集均取于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>，有关范畴和函子集合在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中处理。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,G\">\\(F,G\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 上的层，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h,k\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(F,G)\">\\(h,k\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(F,G)\\)</span>；茎映射见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"35aa7f1836ebd037\" href=\"?note=35aa7f1836ebd037\" title=\"14-df-stalk-maps\">14-df-stalk-maps</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Nat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Nat}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"83765a3303e549f5\" href=\"?note=83765a3303e549f5\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections\">14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections</a> 中的精确签名。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{id}_A\">\\(\\mathrm{id}_A\\)</span> 表示集合或函子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的恒等映射。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"h=k\\iff\\forall x\\in X\\;(h_x=k_x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[h=k\\iff\\forall x\\in X\\;(h_x=k_x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\exists u\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(G,F)\\;(uh=\\mathrm{id}_F\\land hu=\\mathrm{id}_G)\\right)\\iff\\forall x\\in X\\;(h_x:F_x\\xrightarrow{\\sim}G_x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\exists u\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(G,F)\\;(uh=\\mathrm{id}_F\\land hu=\\mathrm{id}_G)\\right)\\iff\\forall x\\in X\\;(h_x:F_x\\xrightarrow{\\sim}G_x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：相同的茎像意味着各截面的像逐点在某邻域相等，分离性推出截面像相等。若所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_x\">\\(h_x\\)</span> 双射，给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in G(U)\">\\(t\\in G(U)\\)</span>，每点在较小邻域上选择原像截面；像茎相等再缩小可令像截面等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span>。这些原像在交上因茎单射而相等，故拼接为唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in F(U)\">\\(s\\in F(U)\\)</span>。所得逆分量与限制相容，构成自然逆。反向由函子性立即得到。空空间也成立：其层的空集值必为单点。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-stalk-maps","status":"resolved","id":"35aa7f1836ebd037","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-stalk-maps]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-sheaf-recovery-from-germ-sections","status":"resolved","id":"b95e7093b0f57f47","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-recovery-from-germ-sections]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections","status":"resolved","id":"83765a3303e549f5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-stalk-maps","status":"resolved","id":"35aa7f1836ebd037","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $F,G$ 是 $X$ 上的层，$h,k\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(F,G)$；茎映射见 [[14-df-stalk-maps]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections","status":"resolved","id":"83765a3303e549f5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Nat}$ 沿用 [[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]] 中的精确签名。 $\\mathrm{id}_A$ 表示集合或函子 $A$ 的恒等映射。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"F,G","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"h,k\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(F,G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Nat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{id}_A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"h=k\\iff\\forall x\\in X\\;(h_x=k_x).","display":true},{"tex":"\\left(\\exists u\\in\\mathrm{Nat}_X(G,F)\\;(uh=\\mathrm{id}_F\\land hu=\\mathrm{id}_G)\\right)\\iff\\forall x\\in X\\;(h_x:F_x\\xrightarrow{\\sim}G_x).","display":true},{"tex":"h_x","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in G(U)","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in F(U)","display":false}],"bytes":1782,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-82","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-stalks-detect-equality-and-isomorphisms|Theorem II.6 Stalks Detect Equality and Isomorphisms]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-80","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-stalks-detect-equality-and-isomorphisms]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-237","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-stalks-detect-equality-and-isomorphisms]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-159","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-stalks-detect-equality-and-isomorphisms]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-83","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-stalks-detect-equality-and-isomorphisms|Theorem II.6 Stalks Detect Equality and Isomorphisms]]"},{"id":"1dc2712cae6cd02a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["35aa7f1836ebd037","b95e7093b0f57f47","83765a3303e549f5"]}